Package: statsnzreleases
Title: Import and Standardise Stats NZ Economic Release Files
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Chartwell", family = "Macro",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "chartwellmacro@gmail.com")
Description: Discovers, downloads, caches, and standardises data files attached
    to major Stats NZ economic information releases. The package uses the
    official Stats NZ release-calendar endpoint and information-release pages;
    it does not query the Aotearoa Data Explorer data API.
    It preserves attachment-level provenance and supports reproducible reads
    from explicit historical release URLs.
